    <briefdescription>
<para>Material that draws error bars from (x, y, low, high) data points in a data texture. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each error bar takes <computeroutput>kVerticesPerErrorBar</computeroutput> vertices: two triangles each for the line and the two caps. The shader derives the error bar, part, and corner from the vertex index. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
